{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>LocalToolbox 是一款主打私隱的完全離線工具箱，把日常生活、工作記錄、學習、圖像與 PDF 處理所需的工具集合在一個 App 之內，適合不願把相片、文件或影片上傳到雲端服務的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-119.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線運算守護私隱</h2>\n<p>App 內建超過 200 款實用工具，涵蓋測量、計時、單位換算、文字處理、開發者工具、財務記錄、圖像與 PDF 處理及媒體編輯。所有運算均在裝置本地完成，無需登入、不用連網，亦沒有廣告與訂閱。新版本加入離線文字辨識、文件掃描、自動遮蔽卡號與人臉、影片壓縮等功能。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-576-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-577-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-578-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-579-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-580-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：LocalToolbox : Offline Tools</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/localtoolbox-offline-tools/id6761979934?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:19.653994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:59:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:13.358628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:35.936810+00:00","content_hash":"00897d37ba56275de2113630d071edcb239c96d814d5107fbfa0c28531ddce86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:19.653994+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}